cue0098158
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
My point is that this is not a unique Jewish phenomenon.

cue0098159
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:04.000
You cannot have literature, any literature, any written word, unless you have previously an oral tradition.

cue0098160
