You need a Terashik Echtav, to be able to connect the written word.

cue0098164
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:45.000
So, all in all, any literature, a sign, a traffic sign, cannot be properly understood unless you have a Terashik Alpeh.

cue0098165
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.000
